mcprack-client (1.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release — shared library for Claude/Cursor/VS Code sync utils.
  * Refuse server entries that would make the client run a program or
    talk to another origin (D-01); send the token only over
    https/loopback, never follow redirects, bound the answer; private
    .bak, symlink-safe, concurrent-save-safe writes; configure reads the
    token from a file or prompt.

